    }
    patterns={
        {"^Your Hearthstone takes you to (.-)%. You are questing in (.-), so the inn in (.-) would save you long runs: talk to the innkeeper and choose \034Make this inn your home\034%.$","Ta Pierre de foyer t'emm\195\168ne \195\160 %1. Tu fais tes qu\195\170tes \195\160 %2\194\160; l'auberge de %3 t'\195\169viterait donc de longs trajets\194\160: parle \195\160 l'aubergiste et choisis \034Faites de cette auberge votre foyer\034."},
        {"^Guided route: step (%-?%d+) of (%-?%d+)%. It moves on as you pick up and hand in quests; /bf route skip skips a step, /bf route zone goes back to this zone's steps%.$","Route guid\195\169e\194\160: \195\169tape %1 sur %2. Elle avance quand tu prends et rends des qu\195\170tes\194\160; /bf route skip passe une \195\169tape, /bf route zone revient aux \195\169tapes de cette zone."},
        {"^(.-) accepted%. /bf mentor step asks for their next step, /bf mentor way sends your waypoint, /bf mentor say sends a note, /bf mentor end stops%.$","%1 a accept\195\169. /bf mentor step demande sa prochaine \195\169tape, /bf mentor way envoie ton point de passage, /bf mentor say envoie une note, /bf mentor end arr\195\170te."},
        {"^Group quests in your log: (%-?%d+)%. Click a line, or type /bf group 1, to put it in your chat box%. Nothing is sent until you press Enter%.$","Qu\195\170tes de groupe dans ton journal\194\160: %1. Clique sur une ligne, ou tape /bf group 1, pour la mettre dans ta zone de chat. Rien n'est envoy\195\169 tant que tu n'appuies pas sur Entr\195\169e."},
        {"^(.-) offers to be your mentor and asks to see your next step%. Type /bf mentor accept to share it%. Nothing is shared unless you do%.$","%1 propose d'\195\170tre ton mentor et demande \195\160 voir ta prochaine \195\169tape. Tape /bf mentor accept pour la partager. Rien n'est partag\195\169 sans \195\167a."},
        {"^Group quests in your log: (%-?%d+)%. Type /bf group 1 to put the first line in your chat box%. Nothing is sent until you press Enter%.$","Qu\195\170tes de groupe dans ton journal\194\160: %1. Tape /bf group 1 pour mettre la premi\195\168re ligne dans ta zone de chat. Rien n'est envoy\195\169 tant que tu n'appuies pas sur Entr\195\169e."},
        {"^The guided route ends at level (%-?%d+) for now%. The zone guide takes over; the desktop app's Now page shows where to level next%.$","La route guid\195\169e s'arr\195\170te au niveau %1 pour l'instant. Le guide de zone prend le relais\194\160; la page Maintenant de l'app montre o\195\185 monter en niveau ensuite."},
        {"^It takes you to (.-), but you are questing in (.-)%. Talk to the innkeeper in (.-) and choose \034Make this inn your home\034%.$","Elle t'emm\195\168ne \195\160 %1, mais tu fais tes qu\195\170tes \195\160 %2. Parle \195\160 l'aubergiste de %3 et choisis \034Faites de cette auberge votre foyer\034."},
        {"^Backstage Forever live: (.-) \194\183 (.-) (%-?%d+)x(%-?%d+) px at (.-) \194\183 strip (.-) \194\183 (.-)x units \194\183 scale (%-?[%d%.]+) \194\183 screen (.-) \194\183 paints (%-?%d+)(.-)(.-)$","Backstage Forever live\194\160: %1 \194\183 %2 %3x%4 px \195\160 %5 \194\183 bande %6 \194\183 %7x unit\195\169s \194\183 \195\169chelle %8 \194\183 \195\169cran %9 \194\183 dessins %10%11%12"},
        {"^Full in about (.-) at an inn or city, about (.-) elsewhere%. Reference rate: one bar per 8 hours in an inn or city%.$","Pleine dans environ %1 dans une auberge ou une ville, environ %2 ailleurs. Taux de r\195\169f\195\169rence\194\160: une barre toutes les 8 heures dans une auberge ou une ville."},
        {"^Moment toasts are (.-)%. The desktop app shows every moment either way; turn its moments off in Settings there%.$","Banni\195\168res de moments\194\160: %1. L'app montre chaque moment dans tous les cas\194\160; d\195\169sactive ses moments dans ses R\195\169glages."},
        {"^(%-?%d+) item(.-) no longer work until repaired%. Visit a blacksmith or armor vendor: /bf repair shows the nearest%.$","%1 objet%2 hors d'usage jusqu'\195\160 r\195\169paration. Va voir un forgeron ou un marchand d'armures\194\160: /bf repair montre le plus proche."},
        {"^Soft reserves kept by (.-): (%-?%d+)%. A reserve is a wish, not a promise; nothing is rolled or handed out for you%.$","Soft-reserves gard\195\169es par %1\194\160: %2. Une r\195\169serve est un souhait, pas une promesse\194\160; rien n'est tir\195\169 au sort ni distribu\195\169 \195\160 ta place."},
        {"^Your Hearthstone takes you to (.-)%. To change it, talk to an innkeeper and choose \034Make this inn your home\034%.$","Ta Pierre de foyer t'emm\195\168ne \195\160 %1. Pour la changer, parle \195\160 un aubergiste et choisis \034Faites de cette auberge votre foyer\034."},
        {"^Asked sharing guild members who can make \034(.-)\034%. Type /bf guild craft in a few seconds to read the answers%.$","Demand\195\169 aux membres de la guilde qui partagent qui peut fabriquer \034%1\034. Tape /bf guild craft dans quelques secondes pour lire les r\195\169ponses."},
        {"^Your soft%-reserve list: (%-?%d+)%. A reserve is a wish, not a promise; nothing is rolled or handed out for you%.$","Ta liste de soft-reserve\194\160: %1. Une r\195\169serve est un souhait, pas une promesse\194\160; rien n'est tir\195\169 au sort ni distribu\195\169 \195\160 ta place."},
        {"^(.-) also marks quest enemies, so our quest icons over enemies are off%. /bf plates on turns them back on%.$","%1 marque aussi les ennemis de qu\195\170te\194\160; nos ic\195\180nes de qu\195\170te sur les ennemis sont donc d\195\169sactiv\195\169es. /bf plates on les r\195\169active."},
        {"^(.-) asked for a readiness check%. Your short status went to your party%. /bf check answers off stops that%.$","%1 a demand\195\169 une v\195\169rification de pr\195\169paration. Ton court \195\169tat est parti vers ton groupe. /bf check answers off arr\195\170te \195\167a."},
        {"^(.-) has its own shopping list, so ours stays closed at the auction house%. /bf shop on turns it back on%.$","%1 a sa propre liste de courses\194\160; la n\195\180tre reste donc ferm\195\169e \195\160 l'h\195\180tel des ventes. /bf shop on la r\195\169active."},
        {"^(.-) is now your mentor: they can ask for your next step and suggest waypoints%. /bf mentor end stops it%.$","%1 est maintenant ton mentor\194\160: il peut demander ta prochaine \195\169tape et proposer des points de passage. /bf mentor end l'arr\195\170te."},
        {"^Asked (.-)%. They see one chat line and must type /bf mentor accept%. Without the addon they see nothing%.$","Demand\195\169 \195\160 %1. Il voit une ligne de chat et doit taper /bf mentor accept. Sans l'addon, il ne voit rien."},
        {"^No sharing guild member answered for \034(.-)\034%. They need Backstage Forever, /bf guild on and the recipe%.$","Aucun membre de la guilde qui partage n'a r\195\169pondu pour \034%1\034. Il leur faut Backstage Forever, /bf guild on et la recette."},
        {"^Timing is on for (%-?%d+) event handlers%. Play for a while, then type /bf perf%. /bf perf off stops it%.$","Le chronom\195\169trage est activ\195\169 pour %1 gestionnaires d'\195\169v\195\168nements. Joue un moment, puis tape /bf perf. /bf perf off l'arr\195\170te."},
        {"^You are the mentor of (.-)%. /bf mentor step, /bf mentor way, /bf mentor say words, /bf mentor end%.$","Tu es le mentor de %1. /bf mentor step, /bf mentor way, /bf mentor say mots, /bf mentor end."},
        {"^Price memory (.-), (%-?%d+) items%. The desktop app shows it all under Ledger after /reload or logout%.$","M\195\169moire des prix\194\160: %1, %2 objets. L'app montre tout dans Registre apr\195\168s /reload ou d\195\169connexion."},
        {"^(.-) also draws quest pins on the minimap, so ours are off%. /bf minimap on turns them back on%.$","%1 dessine aussi des rep\195\168res de qu\195\170te sur la minicarte\194\160; les n\195\180tres sont donc d\195\169sactiv\195\169s. /bf minimap on les r\195\169active."},
        {"^(.-) is at (%-?%d+)%% durability and (%-?%d+) more are under 20%%%. Repair before you head out: /bf repair%.$","%1 est \195\160 %2%% de durabilit\195\169 et %3 autres sont sous 20%%. R\195\169pare avant de partir\194\160: /bf repair."},
        {"^You reached the limit of this rank%. Learn (.-) (.-) from a profession trainer to keep going%.$","Tu as atteint la limite de ce rang. Apprends %1 %2 aupr\195\168s d'un ma\195\174tre de m\195\169tier pour continuer."},
        {"^Your mentor (.-) suggests a waypoint: (.-) at (%-?[%d%.]+), (%-?[%d%.]+)%. Type /bf mentor go to follow it%.$","Ton mentor %1 propose un point de passage\194\160: %2 \195\160 %3, %4. Tape /bf mentor go pour le suivre."},
        {"^%+(%-?%d+) XP \194\183 about (%-?%d+) more quest(.-) like this to level up%. /bf next shows the nearest one%.$","+%1 XP \194\183 encore environ %2 qu\195\170te%3 comme \195\167a pour monter de niveau. /bf next montre la plus proche."},
        {"^Assignment sent to (.-): (.-)%. They see it only with Backstage Forever and raid comms on%.$","Attribution envoy\195\169e \195\160 %1\194\160: %2. Il ne la voit qu'avec Backstage Forever et la communication de raid activ\195\169e."},
        {"^Sell to a vendor: (%-?%d+) item(.-) for (.-) %(the Sell junk button on a vendor does the greys%)%.$","\195\128 vendre \195\160 un marchand\194\160: %1 objet%2 pour %3 (le bouton Vendre le gris chez un marchand s'occupe des objets gris)."},
        {"^Asked sharing guild members who can make \034(.-)\034%. The answers follow in a few seconds%.$","Demand\195\169 aux membres de la guilde qui partagent qui peut fabriquer \034%1\034. Les r\195\169ponses arrivent dans quelques secondes."},
        {"^You have (%-?%d+) sets, the most the addon keeps%. Delete one first %(/bf set delete NAME%)%.$","Tu as %1 ensembles, le maximum que l'addon garde. Supprimes-en un d'abord (/bf set delete NOM)."},
        {"^Price memory is (.-): (%-?%d+) item prices remembered from Auction House pages you opened%.$","M\195\169moire des prix\194\160: %1. %2 prix d'objets retenus sur les pages de l'h\195\180tel des ventes que tu as ouvertes."},
        {"^This session: (%-?%d+) fights, (%-?%d+) damage, (%-?%d+) damage per second on average %(solo fights%)%.$","Cette session\194\160: %1 combats, %2 d\195\169g\195\162ts, %3 d\195\169g\195\162ts par seconde en moyenne (combats en solo)."},
        {"^Scout mode is off%. Records on this character: (%-?%d+)%. /bf scout on starts recording%.$","Le mode \195\169claireur est d\195\169sactiv\195\169. Notes sur ce personnage\194\160: %1. /bf scout on commence \195\160 noter."},
        {"^Waypoint set: (.-) at (%-?[%d%.]+), (%-?[%d%.]+)%. Follow the arrow on your minimap and screen%.$","Point de passage plac\195\169\194\160: %1 \195\160 %2, %3. Suis la fl\195\168che sur ta minicarte et ton \195\169cran."},
        {"^Your last answers from the companion: (%-?%d+)%. They are as of your last /reload%.$","Tes derni\195\168res r\195\169ponses du compagnon\194\160: %1. Elles datent de ton dernier /reload."},
        {"^(.-) is your mentor and may ask for your next step%. /bf mentor end stops it%.$","%1 est ton mentor et peut demander ta prochaine \195\169tape. /bf mentor end l'arr\195\170te."},
        {"^Bag marks are drawn on the game's own bags only, not in the windows of (.-)%.$","Les marques de sac ne sont dessin\195\169es que sur les sacs du jeu, pas dans les fen\195\170tres de %1."},
        {"^Level (%-?%d+) talent point: (.-) %((.-)%), rank (%-?%d+) of (%-?%d+)%. Type /bf talents for more%.$","Point de talent du niveau %1\194\160: %2 (%3), rang %4 sur %5. Tape /bf talents pour en savoir plus."},
        {"^Gear hints (.-): upgrade lines on item tooltips and the best quest reward%.$","Conseils d'\195\169quipement\194\160: %1. Lignes d'am\195\169lioration dans les infobulles d'objets et meilleure r\195\169compense de qu\195\170te."},
        {"^(.-) shares a waypoint: (.-) at (%-?[%d%.]+), (%-?[%d%.]+)%. Type /bf party go to follow it%.$","%1 partage un point de passage\194\160: %2 \195\160 %3, %4. Tape /bf party go pour le suivre."},
        {"^Elite %(level (%-?%d+)%): hits like several normal enemies%. Bring a group%.$","\195\137lite (niveau %1)\194\160: frappe comme plusieurs ennemis normaux. Viens en groupe."},
        {"^Level (%-?%d+): a hard fight%. Pull it alone and use everything you have%.$","Niveau %1\194\160: un combat difficile. Attire-le seul et utilise tout ce que tu as."},
        {"^Your notes on players: (%-?%d+)%. /bf note Name shows one and deletes it%.$","Tes notes sur des joueurs\194\160: %1. /bf note Nom en affiche une et la supprime."},
        {"^(.-): back on%. The addon it stepped aside for is no longer running%.$","%1\194\160: r\195\169activ\195\169. L'addon auquel il laissait la place n'est plus actif."},
        {"^Mentor link with (.-) ended: you are no longer in a party together%.$","Lien de mentor avec %1 termin\195\169\194\160: vous n'\195\170tes plus dans le m\195\170me groupe."},
        {"^New skills may be waiting: (.-) in (.-)%. Type /bf train for an arrow%.$","De nouvelles comp\195\169tences t'attendent peut-\195\170tre\194\160: %1 \195\160 %2. Tape /bf train pour une fl\195\168che."},
        {"^(.-) is at (%-?%d+)%% durability%. Repair before you head out: /bf repair%.$","%1 est \195\160 %2%% de durabilit\195\169. R\195\169pare avant de partir\194\160: /bf repair."},
        {"^No answer from (%-?%d+) %(no addon, raid comms off, or answers off%)%.$","Pas de r\195\169ponse de %1 (pas d'addon, communication de raid d\195\169sactiv\195\169e ou r\195\169ponses d\195\169sactiv\195\169es)."},
        {"^You have no note on (.-)%. To write one: /bf note (.-) your words%.$","Tu n'as pas de note sur %1. Pour en \195\169crire une\194\160: /bf note %2 tes mots."},
        {"^Set names are 1 to 24 letters, numbers, spaces or dashes%. (.-)$","Les noms d'ensemble font 1 \195\160 24 lettres, chiffres, espaces ou tirets. %1"},
        {"^  (.-): (%-?%d+) items, (%-?%d+) worn now, (%-?%d+) in your bags, (%-?%d+) elsewhere%.$","  %1\194\160: %2 objets, %3 port\195\169s maintenant, %4 dans tes sacs, %5 ailleurs."},
        {"^Cannot place a waypoint on map (%-?%d+) here; head to (%-?[%d%.]+), (%-?[%d%.]+)%.$","Impossible de placer un point de passage sur la carte %1 ici\194\160; va \195\160 %2, %3."},
        {"^Waypoint suggested to (.-)%. They decide whether to follow it%.$","Point de passage propos\195\169 \195\160 %1. C'est lui qui d\195\169cide de le suivre."},
        {"^Level (%-?%d+), (%-?%d+) above you: very likely to kill you%. Avoid it%.$","Niveau %1, %2 au-dessus de toi\194\160: il te tuera tr\195\168s probablement. \195\137vite-le."},
        {"^You have no note on (.-)%. To write one: /bf note your words%.$","Tu n'as pas de note sur %1. Pour en \195\169crire une\194\160: /bf note tes mots."},
        {"^Your gear has lost (%-?%d+)%% of its durability%. Most worn first:$","Ton \195\169quipement a perdu %1%% de sa durabilit\195\169. Le plus us\195\169 d'abord\194\160:"},
